type: software
title: "sparse-wq-ml-regression"
abstract: >-
  Code and data to reproduce the data-driven results of a study forecasting
  laboratory-measured lake water quality from native profiler, intake and weather
  series with Gaussian process, multiple linear regression and XGBoost models.
